{"words": [{"text": "وَلِلَّهِ", "translation": "And to Allah (belongs)"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "(is) in"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "translation": "the heavens"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and what"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "(is) in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "يَغْفِرُ", "translation": "He forgives"}, {"text": "لِمَن", "translation": "[for] whom"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "وَيُعَذِّبُ", "translation": "and punishes"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "whom"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ ۚ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "غَفُورٌۭ", "translation": "(is) Oft-Forgiving"}, {"text": "رَّحِيمٌۭ", "translation": "Most Merciful"}], "sahih": "And to Allāh belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. He forgives whom He wills and punishes whom He wills. And Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful."}